  "story": {
    "title": "The Moon and the Mouse",
    "bgm": "bgm_night",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b4_u09_1",
        "desc": "Night on a flat castle rooftop garden high among the towers. A big dark cloud hides the moon, so everything is dim and the next tower's door can't be seen. A small grey mouse peeks out of a tiny wooden house by the chimney on the red tiled roof. Bun holds up her paw to see; Hedgie looks up at the cloud; Pip reads in pieces; Fairy E glows softly like a little lamp. Hidden in the picture: the cloud, the moon behind it, the tiny house, the roof. Grumble does NOT appear. No letters anywhere.",
        "hidden": [
          "cloud",
          "moon",
          "house",
          "roof"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Look up! No moon!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l1",
            "ko": "위를 봐요! 달이 없어요!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "A cloud is on the moon.",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l2",
            "ko": "구름이 달을 가렸어."
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Clo... ud? Clo-ud?",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l3",
            "ko": "클로… 우드? 클로-우드?"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "밤, 성 옥상 정원이에요. 커다란 구름이 달을 가려 깜깜해요. 굴뚝 옆 작은 집에서 생쥐가 내다봐요. 핍은 \"클로-우드?\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What hides the moon?",
            "ko": "무엇이 달을 가렸어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Who is in the tiny house?",
            "ko": "작은 집에 누가 있어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b4_u09_2",
        "desc": "Fairy E flies up toward the dark cloud and touches two little sparkles together with her star wand; they melt into one big bright sparkle. As the friends read the word, the cloud puffs apart into little wisps and drifts away, and a big round glowing moon comes out, lighting the rooftop silver. Beads stands on the chimney clicking its beads; Bun and Hedgie cheer. A straw broom leans on the chimney. Hidden in the picture: the cloud, the moon, the broom. Grumble does NOT appear. No letters anywhere.",
        "hidden": [
          "cloud",
          "moon",
          "broom"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/kl/ /aʊ/ /d/ cloud!",
            "audio": "blend_cloud__beads",
            "pop": "cloud",
            "ko": "/kl/ /aʊ/ /d/ 구름!"
          },
          {
            "who": "fairy",
            "text": "Eee! Out, cloud, out!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l4",
            "ko": "이~! 구름아, 비켜, 비켜!"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "The moon is out!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l5",
            "ko": "달이 나왔어요!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b4_u09_1",
        "ko": "반짝이 둘이 하나로! \"cloud!\" 하자 구름이 흩어지고 커다란 달이 나와 옥상이 은빛으로 환해져요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Where does the cloud go?",
            "ko": "구름은 어디로 갔어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What comes out?",
            "ko": "무엇이 나왔어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b4_u09_3",
        "desc": "In the moonlight the little grey mouse comes out of its tiny house holding its cheek; it opens its mouth wide to show one wobbly front tooth. Hedgie kneels to look; Bun holds out a yellow rain boot for the mouse to sit in; Pip reads proudly. The straw broom sweeps the rooftop all by itself. Hidden in the picture: the mouse, the house, the mouth, the tooth, the boot. Grumble does NOT appear. No letters anywhere.",
        "hidden": [
          "mouse",
          "house",
          "mouth",
          "tooth",
          "boot"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "/aʊ/ /aʊ/ mouse!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l6",
            "ko": "/aʊ/ /aʊ/ 생쥐!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "A mouse in a house!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l7",
            "ko": "집 안에 생쥐가!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Mouse! Mouth! Tooth!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l8",
            "ko": "생쥐! 입! 이!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "달빛 아래 생쥐가 나와 입을 크게 벌려요. 앞니가 흔들흔들! 빗자루가 혼자 옥상을 쓸어요. 핍은 이번엔 술술 읽어요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What is wrong with the mouse?",
            "ko": "생쥐는 어디가 아파?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What sweeps the roof?",
            "ko": "무엇이 옥상을 쓸어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b4_u09_4",
        "desc": "Under the big moon, Grumble lies on a soft red couch on the rooftop with his lantern and drum beside him, gazing up at the moon with a peaceful face; he pats the couch for the friends to sit. Bun and Hedgie climb onto the couch; the mouse sits in the yellow boot; Pip snuggles on Grumble's shoulder; the broom leans against the couch. Hidden in the picture: the couch, the moon, the broom, the boot. No letters anywhere.",
        "hidden": [
          "couch",
          "moon",
          "broom",
          "boot"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh... Sit. Look at the moon.",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l9",
            "ko": "쉿… 앉아. 달 좀 봐."
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "The moon is so big!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l10",
            "ko": "달이 엄청 커!"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Grumble is a pal!",
            "audio": "b4_u09_l11",
            "ko": "그럼블은 이제 친구예요!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b4_u09_2",
        "ko": "옥상 소파에 누운 그럼블이 소파를 톡톡 두드려 친구들을 불러요. 모두 나란히 앉아 달을 봐요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Where is Grumble?",
            "ko": "그럼블은 어디에 누워 있어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What do they look at?",
            "ko": "모두 무엇을 봐?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "synopsis_ko": "밤, 성 옥상 정원. 커다란 구름이 달을 가려 깜깜해요. 핍은 \"클로-우드?\" 요정 이가 반짝이 둘을 하나로 합치고 \"cloud!\" 하자 구름이 흩어지고 달이 나와요. 작은 집에서 나온 생쥐는 이가 흔들려요. 그럼블이 옥상 소파에 누워 \"쉿… 달 좀 봐.\" 하며 친구들을 불러요.",
    "so_far_ko": "배를 타고 해자를 건넜어요. 그럼블이 토스트를 그릇에 담아 줬어요.",
    "goal_ko": "두 모음이 한 소리를 내는 oo·ou 단어를 읽고 달이 나오게 해요."
  },
